      "zotero_refs": "[Z5FZQCNC]: 143. Lineage of exposition (bshad pa) of the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) as received by\u202fBu ston (ID:5999): from PaN chen \u015a\u0101kya\u015br\u012b (ID:6418), Chos rje Sa skya pa (ID:3892), 'U yug pa bSod seng (ID:3846), Khang sten 'Od zer rgyal mtshan (ID:7647), Slob dpon Tshad ma pa (i.e., Tshad ma\u2019i skyes bu bSod nams mgon (ID:6925)), Bu ston (ID:5999). \r\n[Z5FZQCNC]: 143-144. Lineage of the reading transmission (lung) of the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) as received by Bu ston (ID:5999): from rNgog lo tsA ba (ID:3786) to Khyung Rin chen grags (ID:3809), rGya dmar Byang chub grags (ID:3834), Phywa ba (ID:3831), gTsang nag pa (ID:3839), Dar ma bkra shis (ID:6217), gNyal pa (i.e., gNyal zhig \u2018Jam pa\u2019i rdo rje (ID:3887)), Bo dong pa (probably (ID:3904)), lDong pa Grags pa dpal (ID:7761), Lho pa Grub seng (ID:7651), Tshad ma'i skyes bu (ID:6925), Bu ston (ID:5999).\r\nSee also [CTAI38G9]: 928.\r\n[CTAI38G9]: 939.  Lineage of the Pram\u0101\u1e47avini\u015bcaya (ID:3774) according to Bu ston (ID:5999)\u2019s student sGra tshad pa (ID:7772) or one of his students. After several other Indian figures it begins with gZhan phan bzang po (Parahitabhadra (ID:3798)), followed by rNgog lo tsA ba (ID:3786), Khyung Rin chen grags (ID:3809), rGya dmar (ID:3834), Cha pa (ID:3831), gTsang nag pa (ID:3839), Dan 'bag pa (ID:3840), gNyal zhig (ID:3887), Bo dong Rin chen (ID:3904), lDong[s] Grags pa dpal (ID:7761), <Lho pa> Grub pa seng ge (ID:7651), Tshad ma'i skyes bu (ID:6925), Bu ston (ID:5999), Thugs sras lo tsA ba (ID:7772).",
